      "reasoning": "The learner has found $n^2=mp$. Use that in the discriminant. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"1 - 4\") -> -3] Arithmetic check: $1-4=-3$, so $n^2-4n^2=(1-4)n^2=-3n^2$.",
